{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111543","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111543/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111543/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111543/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111543","id":3506615208,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7RArOo","number":111543,"title":"`RichTextLabel` only applies the most topmost `RichTextEffect`","user":{"login":"398utubzyt","id":46660281,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjYwMjgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46660281?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt","html_url":"https://github.com/398utubzyt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-10-12T03:18:13Z","updated_at":"2025-10-12T07:34:38Z","closed_at":"2025-10-12T03:54:30Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible with:\n- v4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n- v4.5.1.rc2.official [69796bf7d]\n- v4.0.stable.official [92bee43ad]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-7700K CPU @ 4.20GHz (8 threads) - 31.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n`RichTextLabel` only processes the topmost custom effect in the stack instead of processing all of them. It's worth noting that built-in effects like italics and rainbow still work as expected.\n\nMRP Scripts:\n```gdscript\nextends RichTextLabel\n\nfunc _ready():\n\tadd_text(\"Normal text \")\n\tpush_customfx(TextEffectRed.new(), {})\n\tpush_customfx(TextEffectWave.new(), {})\n\tadd_text(\"Red wavy text \")\n\tpop()\n\tadd_text(\"Just red \")\n\tpop()\n\tadd_text(\"Normal text again\")\n```\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name TextEffectRed extends RichTextEffect\n\nfunc _process_custom_fx(char_fx):\n\tchar_fx.color = Color.RED\n```\n\n```gdscript\nclass_name TextEffectWave extends RichTextEffect\n\nfunc _process_custom_fx(char_fx):\n\tchar_fx.offset.y = sin(char_fx.elapsed_time * TAU + char_fx.relative_index * 0.5) * 2.0\n```\n\nCurrent result:\n<img width=\"431\" height=\"114\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f67c00c8-9ad9-483c-8f4c-e6a1fe0939b5\" />\n\nExpected result:\n<img width=\"431\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f0b1cf9-be79-4202-a748-fb0ba9f5d1c6\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPush two or more custom effects to a `RichTextLabel`. In the MRP, open `test.tscn` and run the project.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[richtextlabel_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22868683/richtextlabel_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"398utubzyt","id":46660281,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjYwMjgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46660281?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt","html_url":"https://github.com/398utubzyt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/398utubzyt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111543/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111543/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}